{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "7a353854e113a4384ddcfbc2201415cc39578918486c313e2c547a910dc3a4e7", "ja": "怪盗シャインナイトの罠！", "zh": "怪盗光辉骑士的陷阱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f3f002a67a03623c50faed2abb0f2dcce1cf556fee30f3b7f040e3e13a7ca3aa", "ja": "オークションに潜入した月兎隊。だが、新人\nナナシの裏切りにより大ピンチに。その正体\nは、同業者である怪盗シャインナイトだっ\nた。しかし彼女もまたオークションマスター\nに裏切られ、月兎隊と共に捕まってしまう。", "zh": "潜入拍卖会的月兔队。然而，由于新人无名的背叛，她们陷入了大危机。她的真实身份竟是同行的怪盗闪耀骑士。然而，她也遭到了拍卖会主人的背叛，和月兔队一起被抓住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1000_052kao", "source_sha256": "ac27ff84c690e23c50997f299a5c1563a2debbc1f8a8cde1c9d2cf91533fab53", "ja": "「こちらミス・W、何が起きていますか？\nみなさん、状況を報告してください」", "zh": "“这里是W小姐，发生什么事了？请大家汇报情况。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "491b9ba2998f026a0176c66101200d8046464e3205ee92fbd627c1a5b615c94d", "ja": "え～、私たちを囲んでいる人が、ひい、ふう、みい……\n数えるのが面倒なくらい、大勢いますね～。", "zh": "呃～，围住我们的人，数一、二、三……多到数起来都嫌麻烦呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "ae095797597e5d86d65946f45a2483383a7bfb75022c6081edee49c5020e932c", "ja": "ようするに、罠だったってことね。\nこの周到さ……どこかから情報が漏れてたのかしら？", "zh": "也就是说，这是个陷阱呢。\n如此周到……难道是情报从哪里泄露了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "0c985a6e0451aeb92dbb28d20a4a1b4833f883ae1ae371b9ea24ca16eb1c3fcb", "ja": "「了解。お待ちください。\n今、有力な脱出経路をいくつか……」", "zh": "「了解。请稍候。\n我现在找出了几条可行的脱身路线……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "40c7247c8bafefab211895a11cabfd730c0e3957ad570acae629087eb3d2f60b", "ja": "必要ないわそんなもの。\nそうでしょう、あんたたち？", "zh": "不需要那种东西。\n你们说对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "8552c4b894bcffbeb5c6bd52f37f92635c9bb08a74c7b80a5e93127699def97d", "ja": "第一、お宝を手に入れてもいないのに、\n逃げ帰るわけにはいかないわ！", "zh": "首先，明明还没拿到宝物，怎么能就这样逃回去呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "9225b0ad00c5ceccc68396605ad9271f536bb699a123ee4b0843e90854d6180a", "ja": "そうですね～。どちらにせよ、\n大人しくかえしてくれそうにないですし～。", "zh": "是啊～。不管怎样，对方看起来也不会乖乖把宝物还回来～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "eb30cd510d04894bd2a6a88d1f7b66130263183a9fb99f79bf529755b794c55b", "ja": "だったら、お宝をいただいたほうが良いかと～。", "zh": "那样的话，还是把宝物拿到手比较好吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "4388cfec6ff8b44ff83e1a9c7472fbf11a380936249df8d540a2fe7d07a201a5", "ja": "荒事か、面倒だな……\nでも、やるんだったら、暴れるよ。", "zh": "要动粗吗，真麻烦……不过，既然要做，那我就大闹一场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "c6afdf152bb01a8fda57f2538b110e72feb751202576b772084f14df7ae85d09", "ja": "叩き潰すわよ！\n月兎レディ……！", "zh": "我要把你彻底击溃！\n月兔女士……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "4bfa64393c1226d3797c53683086d1ad7b8dd5bc56b9ce4643754d21d90afc5a", "ja": "……ふふっ。\nそういうわけには、いきません♪", "zh": "……呵呵。\n那可不行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1011_se", "source_sha256": "18fb53b48388f3147e0140b6b17e5b5a659da74253804e40826be7afca221c14", "ja": "バシュッ", "zh": "咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "5dd8fb63e4ac887451936b16f4786c2d8fc69a0d85d94f7f8cc68659721a5618", "ja": "おや～？　なんだか\n眠くなってきましたね～……。", "zh": "哎呀～？总觉得开始困起来了呢～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "c2e9905a4bf108e1619fdacb0dc31aa4356f3ed862e7ca2eba308393fbc2dbeb", "ja": "んむ……私も、眠くなって……。", "zh": "唔……我也，觉得困了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1014_se", "source_sha256": "5e8e2eab075c5210414e51537a05e3eaf921872b27db7647dfb2f07d67790a5d", "ja": "ドサッ", "zh": "咚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "63f996094ee1d4a9af52ce1b5b1f7e0c6c9b55d318af1518358c5e973d95f92d", "ja": "ちょっと、ディーディー、リトル！？\nどうしたのよ、ふたりとも！", "zh": "等一下，迪迪、小莉特！？  \n你们两个怎么了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1016_052kao", "source_sha256": "e0a05690f3cda219daf3ef009f623c11aa039380c6b4cedd1f6c3bfb6525e9d4", "ja": "「みなさん、今度は何が……？\n状況を常に報告して……」　ザザッ", "zh": "“各位，这次又怎么了……？\n请随时汇报状况……”　沙沙——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "220264e59924746cda54cea956a2059bc80294a2f143adaff8411b0050538e19", "ja": "月兎隊に新人として潜り込んで、数ヶ月……\n正直、こんなに時間がかかるとは思いませんでした。", "zh": "以潜伏新人的身份混入月兔队，已经好几个月了……\n说实话，没想到会花这么长时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "9622f85e9b6b7b3dd23de532d178c75665a9b13885de004a413d9c6900cdb93c", "ja": "みんな肝心なところはガード固いし、スキも見せて\nくれないし……やりにくくて、困ってたんですよ？", "zh": "大家在关键的地方都防得很严，也不给我可乘之机……搞得我很难下手，正为难着呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "91a4eb9c87cb78bf1bdec983120fbd15c56c1601984262fc23b05594765b71a9", "ja": "だから情報提供して、協力者を得て、\n混乱に乗じるしかないかなーって思ったんです。", "zh": "所以我就想，或许只能提供情报、找来协助者，趁着混乱行动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "6e4f820494c22670d00a357c6548b455471afe1de58bad2a8709c643288a4e64", "ja": "……！　あんたが、怪盗シャインナイト……！\nくっ……。", "zh": "……！你就是怪盗Shine Knight……！\n可恶……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "537e1d8fc85267a40496250785d704427085a13f1b7bdd295a005a04be9adccd", "ja": "はい♪　シャインナイト、\nお目当ての宝を、頂戴しにまいりました♪", "zh": "没错♪闪耀骑士这就来取走看中的宝物啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1022_acmaster", "source_sha256": "e5aa7079986f60eaae4cbdb9d959b2569bd03e7fc3e9932d9d679c1284877502", "ja": "ご苦労だったな、怪盗シャインナイト。これでもう、\n『ストーンボウル48』を狙われる心配はない……。", "zh": "辛苦你了，怪盗“Shine Knight”。这下就不用担心『Stone Bowl48』被人盯上了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "b1fbd2daf21bcf2e6adf9a295faad5816f638c6ebd95318516d22b94390b565c", "ja": "こちらこそ、協力を得られて助かりましたよ！\nそれで……オークションマスター。", "zh": "我才要感谢你，能得到你的协助真是帮大忙了！\n那么……拍卖大师。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "61b8c476e9881f178f9bc98d01254853904c9240099e2fd37908a361423a2166", "ja": "約束どおり、レディ・Iが持つ\n『輝きのダイヤ』を頂いても？", "zh": "按照约定，可以把莱迪·I持有的“闪耀钻石”给我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1025_acmaster", "source_sha256": "f91abb9e206148496cb44c630a5d3a5f2330e1a454e7dd3f9180824d1829df7d", "ja": "ふっ……そう慌てるな。\nこれでよろしいかな？", "zh": "哼……别这么慌张。\n这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1026_se", "source_sha256": "8533335a9d35d2cbd6809e5b36a0d612d4f601406f2443ea319e62126a269733", "ja": "バシュッ！", "zh": "咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "af2ea0e587d9282ec7829f7369c2d5bbef15a00713f24d870a74dbf55863029d", "ja": "え！？　あ、あれ？　なんで私にまで、\n睡眠ガスを……？　どういう、つもり……。", "zh": "诶！？　啊、咦？为什么连我也被喷了睡眠瓦斯……？你到底想干什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_02_1028_acmaster", "source_sha256": "e66252132d38f2b00349ddb1dd29aa907c57c33e951b6d7020a02afb225f6ce1", "ja": "ウサギどもを全員捕えろ。私のオークションを\n脅かす者は、何人たりとも許さん。……ハハハハハ！", "zh": "把那些兔子全都抓起来。胆敢威胁我的拍卖会，不管是谁都不可饶恕。……哈哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
